    "created_at": "2015-06-13T05:50:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-06-13T05:50:25Z",
    "body": "I think @arv and I decided we would not throw more than necessary for these algorithms. Note that improper usage can already result in a somewhat awkward state, with various nodes being removed from the document before you get an exception. (Due to appending them to the `DocumentFragment`.)\n",
