    "updated_at": "2015-06-13T10:14:16Z",
    "body": "I would prefer an exception in step 2 because it aids in debugging. An awkward state before I get an exception is okay because I can still figure out where I messed up. Silently doing nothing if the parent is missing would be frustrating to debug. \n",
